# Each case runs in a child process with a throwaway HOME and XDG_RUNTIME_DIR, so
# state (timers, notes, moods, joke rotation, pending confirmations) always
# starts empty, and VOICE_REHEARSAL guarantees nothing is executed. The output is
# therefore byte-stable, which is what makes the module split verifiable.
